  "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/url/issues/71 has a long discussion over whether the second argument in `new URL()` should perhaps default to something from the environment. The conclusion from that thread appears to be that it would be better to instead expose a convenience method on the object where that default would come from.\n\nThis would basically parse a URL against the base URL of the document.\n",
